# Action-Specific Error Behaviour

## Place Order

| Failure | User Guidance | Safe Retry | Persist? |
|---|---|---|---|
| Connection inactive | Reconnect required | After reconnect | No |
| Product unavailable | Remove/update lines | Yes | No |
| Suspended | Contact support/admin | After reactivation | No |
| Duplicate submit | Show existing order | Open existing | First only |

## Accept Order

| Failure | Guidance | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Already accepted | Refresh | No double reserve |
| Insufficient stock | Partial/reject path | No negative stock |
| Business suspended | Cannot accept | Pending may need cancel policy |

## Approve Payment

| Failure | Guidance | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Already approved | Show status | No double settlement |
| Allocation invalid | Fix allocation | Outstanding unchanged |
| Duplicate flagged | Review hold | Manual decision |

## Issue Invoice

| Failure | Guidance | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Nothing billable | Fulfil first | No empty invoice |
| Already fully billed | Block | No double liability |
| Tax/price invalid | Fix before issue | Draft remains |

## Raise Return

| Failure | Guidance | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Qty > delivered | Correct qty | No submit |
| Window expired | Closed | No exception silent allow |
| Undelivered item | Ineligible | |

## Apply Credit

| Failure | Guidance | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| No remaining credit | Cannot apply | |
| Invoice paid | Choose another | |
| Expired credit | Cannot apply | |

## Allocate Batch

| Failure | Guidance | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Expired/recalled/quarantined | Choose other batch | |
| Qty unavailable | Reduce qty | Reservations atomic |

